      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789275558191,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collect samples \n - Choose the tissue \n - Store them appropriately\n\nExtract and purify \n - Wet lab techniques\n\nAssess sample integrity  \n - Perform quality checks\n\nDigitise molecular data \n - Sequence  ",
      "fontSize": 21.220519141496144,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Collect samples \n - Choose the tissue \n - Store them appropriately\n\nExtract and purify \n - Wet lab techniques\n\nAssess sample integrity  \n - Perform quality checks\n\nDigitise molecular data \n - Sequence  ",
      "autoResize": true,
